OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless charity 'still here'
OL,4,Adespite closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA homeless charity, which has closed
OL,7,Fits day centre's doors after more than
OL,8,F50 years in a city, has said staff are
OL,9,F"still passionate" about helping people
OL,10,Fand it will continue its outreach work.
OL,12,FThe Foxton Centre has run shelters for
OL,13,Frough sleepers and vulnerable women and
OL,14,Fyoung people in Preston since 1969.
OL,16,FChief Executive Cath Coffey said
OL,17,Fshutting its homeless day centre on Fox
OL,18,FStreet on Friday was "a really
OL,19,Fdifficult day", but she wanted to
OL,20,Freassure people the charity was "still
OL,21,Fhere" and would now offer help out on
OL,22,Fthe streets.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
