OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless charity 'still here'
OL,4,Adespite closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPreston City Council has taken over
OL,7,Frunning homeless day centres in the
OL,8,Fcity and it is due to open one at
OL,9,FOakham Court next Monday.
